    "summary": "With mixed visibility or positions in area terrain, check Benefit of Cover for the defending unit from each shooter’s position. Some shooters may face cover while others do not. In Resolve Attacks, if the shooters use the same weapon, gather dice in separate batches for those two cover outcomes.",
